question.text:
Looking back at the collaboration between Cheng Yanqiu and Shen Zhiwei in the health field, they went through a process from initially discovering data blind spots, to deepening the issues with patient stories, proposing technical solutions, and finally formally initiating the project. Please arrange the following four key stages in chronological order:  
A. Formal initiation of the "Hermes Project," adding narrative logs and ethical reviews;  
B. Cheng Yanqiu discovered "prediction anxiety" and data blind spots;  
C. Cheng Yanqiu proposed the idea of using NLP to extract soft features;  
D. Shen Zhiwei used patient stories to reveal the "disenchantment" of data.
